WEBVTT

00:06:59.489 --> 00:07:01.602
(Laughter)

00:07:01.626 --> 00:07:05.866
Well, it turns out
that these probably weren't bad guys.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.776
There were just bad for me.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:11.451
And as it happens, the algorithms
that were setting us up,

00:07:11.475 --> 00:07:12.856
they weren't bad either.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:16.149
These algorithms were doing exactly
what they were designed to do,

00:07:16.173 --> 00:07:18.764
which was to take
our user-generated information,

00:07:18.788 --> 00:07:20.268
in my case, my résumé,

00:07:20.292 --> 00:07:23.295
and match it up
with other people's information.

00:07:23.319 --> 00:07:24.986
See, the real problem here is that,

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.954
while the algorithms work just fine,

00:07:26.978 --> 00:07:28.209
you and I don't,

00:07:28.233 --> 00:07:30.346
when confronted with blank windows